# Tragic Banshee: "Morbid -- When this creature enters, target creature an opponent controls gets -1/-1 until end of turn. If a
# creature died this turn, that creature gets -13/-13 until end of turn instead." Bot1 kills Bot2's Memnite with Cut Down on
# Bot2's turn 2; by Bot1's turn 3 that is a different turn (CR 700.4: "this turn"), so the Banshee gives only -1/-1 (CR 611.2a)
# to the Ornithopter the Banshee's controller picks, a -1/1 (CR 107.1b), leaving Bot2's Llanowar Elves alone; Bot1's own Memnite may not be chosen (CR 115.1). The shrink
# lasts until end of turn (CR 514.2): on turn 4 the Ornithopter is a 0/2 again.

